msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "The <a href=\":project\">Token</a> module provides a user interface for the site token system. It also adds some additional tokens that are used extensively during site development. Tokens are specially formatted chunks of text that serve as placeholders for a dynamically generated value. For more information, covering both the token system and the additional tools provided by the Token module, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation</a>."
msgstr "<a href=\":project\">令牌</a>模块提供了站点令牌系统的用户接口。它还添加了一些其他令牌，供站点开发期间广泛使用。令牌是特别格式化的文本块，用作动态生成值的占位符。有关更多信息，包括令牌系统和令牌模块提供的其他工具，请参阅<a href=\":online\">联机文档</a>。"

msgid "Uses"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "Your website uses a shared token system for exposing and using placeholder tokens and their appropriate replacement values. This allows for any module to provide placeholder tokens for strings without having to reinvent the wheel. It also ensures consistency in the syntax used for tokens, making the system as a whole easier for end users to use."
msgstr "您的 Web 站点使用共享令牌系统来显示和使用占位符令牌及其相应的替换值。这允许任何模块为字符串提供占位符令牌，而不必全盘重来。它还可确保用于令牌的语法保持一致，使整个系统更易于最终用户使用。"

msgid "The list of the currently available tokens on this site are shown below."
msgstr "下面显示了该站点上当前可用的令牌列表。"

msgid "This field supports tokens. @browse_tokens_link"
msgstr "该字段支持令牌。@browse_tokens_link"

msgid "%name is using the following invalid tokens: @invalid-tokens."
msgstr "%name 正在使用以下无效令牌：@invalid-tokens。"

msgid "This field supports tokens."
msgstr "此字段支持置换符（token）。"

msgid "Available variables are: [site:name], [site:url], [user:display-name], [user:account-name], [user:mail], [site:login-url], [site:url-brief], [user:edit-url], [user:one-time-login-url], [user:cancel-url]."
msgstr "可用的通配符： [site:name], [site:url], [user:display-name], [user:account-name], [user:mail], [site:login-url], [site:url-brief], [user:edit-url], [user:one-time-login-url], [user:cancel-url]."

msgid "The list of available tokens that can be used in e-mails is provided below."
msgstr "下面提供了可在电子邮件中使用的可用令牌列表。"

msgid "Computed menu link for the node (only available during node saving)."
msgstr "节点的计算菜单链接（仅在节点保存期间可用）。"

